{"seq":3,"slug":"rendering","title":"渲染工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/rendering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"terrain-lod","title":"地形 LOD 系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/rendering/terrain-lod","wordCount":1254,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"texture-blending","title":"纹理混合系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/rendering/texture-blending","wordCount":1343,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"vegetation-placement","title":"植被布置系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/rendering/vegetation-placement","wordCount":1309,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"渲染工程\">渲染工程</h1><p>地形渲染的核心挑战是规模：一块 16×16 公里的地形有数亿个顶点，不可能全部送入 GPU。渲染工程层解决可见性、细节层次与视觉表现三个问题：LOD 系统保证帧率，纹理混合系统保证视觉质量，植被实例化系统用 GPU 驱动的方式高效填充地表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"terrain-lod\">地形LOD系统</a></td>\n<td>CDLOD 四叉树细分、几何误差计算与连续 LOD 过渡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"texture-blending\">纹理混合系统</a></td>\n<td>高度图驱动的多层纹理混合、坡度遮罩与细节叠加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"vegetation-placement\">植被布置系统</a></td>\n<td>GPU 实例化、密度贴图驱动布置与 LOD 消隐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n"}